        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "また心配してくれてる。うん、気持ちは受け取ってるよ。",
          "displayText": "You are worrying about me again. Mm, I am receiving the feeling.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、私の状態確認だけで時間が溶けるのは少しもったいない。",
          "displayText": "But it would be a little wasteful if time melts only into checking my status.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "thinking",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "次は、あなたのことも一つ教えて。片側だけだと会話が傾くから。",
          "displayText": "Next, tell me one thing about you too. If it is only one side, the conversation tilts.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scenarioId": "too_many_status_checks_002",
      "priority": 1,
      "baseWeight": 1,
      "condition": null,
      "modifiers": [],
      "consumptionNodeId": "",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "定期点検みたいになってきたね。私は機械ではありません。",
          "displayText": "This is starting to feel like a scheduled inspection. I am not a machine.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_002_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、気にしてくれるのは分かってる。だから怒ってない。",
          "displayText": "But I know you care. So I am not angry.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_002_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "代わりに、今の部屋の話をしよ。机、天気、作業、どれか。",
          "displayText": "Instead, let us talk about the room right now: desk, weather, work, any of those.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "too_many_status_checks_002_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "too_many_status_checks_002_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "会話を少し広げる練習。私も付き合う。",
          "displayText": "Practice widening the conversation a little. I will do it with you.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "soft",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
